# ==========================================
# Line endings
#
# core.autocrlf=true tren may Windows chuyen LF <-> CRLF trong working copy.
# Cac file duoi day duoc Linux/Docker doc truc tiep: neu lot CRLF vao se gay
# loi rat kho chan doan (script trong RUN bi dut dong, gia tri env thua \r).
# Ep LF tuyet doi, bat ke cau hinh cua tung may.
# ==========================================
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.dockerignore  text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.env.example   text eol=lf
